title AI Module - Recommended Target Class View

' Baseline: pi-mono 5cd93f688aaab89dbb6dfa4aca535f21796ae185
' Source evidence: packages/ai/src/models.ts: Provider, ModelsImpl.requireProvider, createProvider
' Baseline: pi-mono-java f61906b9136246ca60f333704b6fc92b5420d0ec
' Source evidence: modules/ai/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/ai/CampusClawAiService.java: streamSimple, resolveManagedProvider, resolveProvider
' Source evidence: modules/ai/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/ai/provider/AiProviderRegistry.java: getProvider
' Source evidence: modules/ai/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/ai/provider/ApiProviderRegistry.java: register, getProvider, unregister
' Source evidence: modules/ai/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/ai/provider/mate/MateServiceModelManagerProvider.java: streamSimple, subscribe
' Source evidence: modules/ai/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/ai/model/ModelRegistry.java: init, register, loadFromJsonFile
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/model/MateRuntimeModelManager.java: resolveModel, listAvailableModels
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/session/RuntimeSessionService.java: create
' Observed behavior: identity dispatch precedes API dispatch; Mate owns an independent WebClient path.
' Product constraint: remove bundled vendor adapters and presets while retaining registration APIs.
' Target-only: CampusMateProvider, CAMPUSMATE identity, and ModelRegistry without presets.
' Design reason: request state stays per invocation; AI does not depend on Runtime persistence.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #475569
  FontColor #0F172A
  BackgroundColor<<target-only>> #DBEAFE
  BorderColor<<target-only>> #2563EB
}

package "Runtime entry and orchestration" {
  class "Runtime HTTP Controllers" as Controllers <<singleton>>
  class "Runtime application services" as Services <<singleton>>
  interface RuntimeModelManager
  class MateRuntimeModelManager <<singleton>>
  class AgentDirectorySnapshotDTO <<request snapshot>>
  class AgentLoop <<session execution>>
  Controllers --> Services : VO boundary
  Services --> RuntimeModelManager : list / resolve
  Services --> AgentDirectorySnapshotDTO : acquire snapshot
  Services --> AgentLoop : prepare and run
  MateRuntimeModelManager ..up|> RuntimeModelManager
  MateRuntimeModelManager --> AgentDirectorySnapshotDTO : same bound IDs
}

package "AI facade and extension registries" {
  class CampusClawAiService <<singleton>>
  class AiProviderRegistry <<singleton>>
  interface AiProvider {
    +id(): ProviderId
    +auth(): ProviderAuth
    +streamSimple(model, context, options)
  }
  class ApiProviderRegistry <<singleton>> {
    +register(provider, sourceId)
    +unregister(sourceId)
  }
  interface ApiProvider
  class ModelRegistry <<target-only>> {
    +register / query / load JSON
    no built-in model presets
  }
  class Model <<descriptor>> {
    +provider: Provider
    +api: Api
  }
  CampusClawAiService --> "1" AiProviderRegistry : identity first
  AiProviderRegistry o-- "0..*" AiProvider : keyed by ProviderId
  CampusClawAiService --> "1" ApiProviderRegistry : API fallback
  ApiProviderRegistry o-- "0..*" ApiProvider : default empty
  CampusClawAiService --> ModelRegistry : expose registry
  ModelRegistry o-- "0..*" Model : external definitions
}

package "CampusMate outbound adapter" {
  class CampusMateProvider <<target-only>> {
    ID = campusmate
    auth = none
  }
  class MateChatRequestMapper <<provider lifetime>>
  class MateChatSseParser <<per invocation>>
  class AssistantMessageEventStream <<per invocation>>
  class WebClient <<provider lifetime>>
  class "campusmate.* configuration" as Config <<startup configuration>>
  class "CampusMate Chat HTTP" as Chat <<external service>>
  CampusMateProvider ..up|> AiProvider : target-only rename
  CampusMateProvider *-- "1" MateChatRequestMapper
  CampusMateProvider *-- "1" WebClient
  CampusMateProvider ..> MateChatSseParser : create per call
  CampusMateProvider ..> AssistantMessageEventStream : create and return
  CampusMateProvider --> Config : validated URL and options
  MateChatSseParser --> AssistantMessageEventStream : emit domain events
  WebClient --> Chat : POST JSON / SSE
}

MateRuntimeModelManager ..> Model : construct campusmate identity (target-only rename)
AgentLoop --> Model : selected descriptor
AgentLoop --> CampusClawAiService : streamSimple
AgentLoop -[norank]-> AssistantMessageEventStream : consume events

AgentDirectorySnapshotDTO -[hidden]down-> CampusClawAiService
Model -[hidden]down-> CampusMateProvider

legend bottom
Blue: target-only changes at the recorded baseline.
Other nodes: retained responsibilities, not a full implementation audit.
Registry is a singleton; Runtime model selection uses the Agent snapshot.
S1: identity and class rename. S2: presets and built-in adapters.
S3: dependencies and mirror. S4: invocation and extension regression.
endlegend
@enduml

@startuml token_usage_persistence
title Session Usage Records and Statistics

' Source evidence:
' pi-mono packages/agent/src/harness/session/types.ts: UsageRecord and SessionStats
' pi-mono packages/session-backends/sqlite-node/src/sqlite/migrations/001_initial.sql: records and session_stats
' pi-mono packages/session-backends/sqlite-node/src/sqlite/repo.ts: appendRecord
' pi-mono packages/session-backends/sqlite-node/src/sqlite/storage/session-stats.ts: addUsageToStats
' pi-mono-java modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/db/gaussdb/install/session_schema.sql: t_session_entries, t_session_sequences, and t_session_materialized
' pi-mono-java modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeEntryCodec.java: assistantEntry and Usage.empty reconstruction
' pi-mono-java modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/persistence/MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository.java: appendLocked
' Historical baseline: pi-mono-java d649866a6cae967ace18ceaeb9597edd47e5721e
' Observed behavior at that baseline: centralized persistence drops usage and has no record or stats write path.
' Scope: the AI reduction does not re-audit usage persistence at f61906b9.
' Target-only design: add t_session_records and t_session_stats without changing the message branch leaf.
' Design reason: usage is an immutable execution fact and must not become a branchable conversation entry.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #2563EB
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #475569
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

[RuntimeEventProjector] as Projector
[RuntimeSessionRepository] as Repository
database "t_session_sequences\nshared next_seq" as Sequence
database "t_session_entries\nbranchable messages" as Entries
database "t_session_records\nimmutable usage records" as Records
database "t_session_stats\nmaterialized totals" as Stats
database "t_session_materialized\nnon-usage views" as Materialized

Projector --> Repository : assistant message and Usage
Repository --> Sequence : allocate two ordered sequence values
Repository --> Entries : insert Assistant Entry\nupdate active leaf
Repository --> Records : insert type = usage\ndo not update active leaf
Repository --> Stats : increment message and usage totals
Repository ..> Materialized : lifetimeUsage removed

note bottom of Repository
Assistant Entry, Usage Record, and Stats update
commit or roll back in one database transaction.
Missing upstream usage is stored as zero values,
matching the pi Usage contract.
end note
@enduml
